Package: omx-qualification-rpi5-zynthian-vangelis
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, plugin-qualify (>= 0.17.0~)
Description: qualification records of the zynthian-vangelis plugin set for rpi5
 The plugin-qualify records of the zynthian-vangelis plugin set, measured on a
 rpi5 device. plugin-qualify-sync takes a plugin from them instead of
 measuring it, and only when every file of the installed plugin hashes as the
 measured one did; any other plugin is measured on the device as before.
